sercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.android.package-archive","state":"uploaded","size":126686789,"digest":"sha256:86acee67f380ca8f772305f2e15fd861a694f154d470a0edf69358fba9b97504","download_count":881,"created_at":"2026-11-06T21:00:36Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T21:00:41Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/releases/download/v1.1.1/Wholphin.apk"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damontecres/Wholphin/tarball/v1.1.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damontecres/Wholphin/zipball/v1.1.1","body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n> This is the final release that will support Jellyfin 10.10 and 10.11!\r\n> \r\n> `v1.2.0`, planned for release in December, will [require Jellyfin 12+](https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/discussions/1640)\r\n\r\n\r\nThis release has a lot!\r\n\r\n- Improvements & overrides for HDR & Dolby Vision playback\r\n- Support for the optional [companion plugin](https://github.com/damontecres/jellyfin-plugin-wholphin)\r\n- More consistent audio/subtitle track selection between episodes\r\n\r\n`v1.1.1` is a quick release to fix a single bug, the majority of changes are from `v1.1.0`.\r\n\r\n### New Features & Enhancements\r\n* New user preference to force enable or disable common HDR and Dolby Vision formats by @whitingj in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1644\r\n* Experimental: Convert Dolby Vision profile 7 to 8.1 on devices without a profile 7 decoder by @SergeiAK in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2017\r\n* Add support for server plugin by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1384\r\n* Auto-configure Discover from Wholphin server plugin by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2134\r\n* Improve track persistence for series & episodes by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1802\r\n* Add Fire OS voice command permission for MediaSession by @mirimsees in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2076\r\n* Change max bitrate during playback by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2097\r\n* Can Select Artist or Album Artist to be displayed on Music > Artists Page by @clintjb in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2127\r\n### UI/UX Improvements\r\n* Rename music \"Top Rated Unwatched\" row to \"Top Rated\" by @bobberb in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2118\r\n* Update playlist details to match library grid by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2113\r\n* Show album artist under album name on album cards by @bobberb in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2117\r\n* Inherit parent view options and sort for sub-folders by @mizuka123 in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2045\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* Fix experimental settings for AC3 surround sound by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2101\r\n* Better handling for Seerr request permissions & minor discover UI tweaks by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2084\r\n* Fix: VLC doesn't restart playback from the beginning as expected by @osipovgleb in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2050\r\n* Fixes to `v1.0.9` by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2072\r\n* Request audio focus for video playback so background music pauses by @hawkinslabdev in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2151\r\n* Allow play/pause from untrusted media controllers by @aalaei in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2145\r\n* Minor bug fix by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2167\r\n* Fix HDHomeRun Live TV direct playback by including the live stream ID by @coulterj in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2163\r\n* Fix adding Seerr server if plugin is not installed by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2179\r\n### Other changes\r\n* Show warning for future unsupported server version by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2115\r\n* Updates to session restoration by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1905\r\n* Include image tags in item image URLs by @4eh5xitv6787h645ebv in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2031\r\n* Add detected HDR info to debug page by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2140\r\n* Update Kotlin to v2.4.21 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2057\r\n* Update actions/upload-artifact digest to cf430e0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2056\r\n* Update dependency org.openapi.generator to v7.26.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2058\r\n* Update Gradle to v9.8.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1818\r\n* Update Github Actions by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2083\r\n* Update Kotlin to v1.12.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2104\r\n* Update Gradle to v9.8.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2103\r\n* Update dependencies by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2157\r\n* Translations 2026-11-03 by @damontecres in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2169\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @whitingj made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/1644\r\n* @mizuka123 made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2045\r\n* @4eh5xitv6787h645ebv made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2031\r\n* @bobberb made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2118\r\n* @mirimsees made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2076\r\n* @osipovgleb made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2050\r\n* @hawkinslabdev made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2151\r\n* @clintjb made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2127\r\n* @aalaei made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2145\r\n* @coulterj made their first contribution in https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/pull/2163\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin/compare/v1.0.9...v1.1.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damontecres/Wholphin/releases/437032004/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":13}